      "text": "THIS IS F*CKING INSANE, I GAVE ONE VAULT TO JEV + OPUS 5.5 AND SLEPT, MY $418 IS NOW $5,469 AFTER 9 NIGHTS\n\nThe vault is one Obsidian folder.\n\nEvery client, brief and invoice is a note in it.\n\nOnly the agents read it.\n\nThe team:\n→ Jev decides which leads are worth chasing\n→ https://t.co/SnVbyUZZdD",
