        "reply_count": 20,
        "retweet_count": 1
      },
      "text": "One AI employee. Which do you hire?\n\nGrok Bot, $30: a team  that makes calls\nClaude Duet, $20: the careful one. You can't get in\nChatGPT dots, $100: won the only independent test\n\nI compared all three, the WIRED test and 25+ posts from daily users ↓ https://t.co/1FR2FIZVNm",
      "url": "https://x.com/molodoykiskaeb/status/2118003024933142861"
