      "text": "OpenAI Dots Pro excludes Switzerland.\n\nI live in Switzerland. I built an agent in Dots anyway. Via Business Premium.\n\nHis name is Kurt. He plans my day, checks my inbox, preps meetings and answers club questions.\n\nThe launch post said no. The plan details said yes.",
