      "text": "Follow-up to my analysis of The @X Subscription, based on 40,618 @grok @bot usage records (Oct 13 – Nov 3, 2026).\n\nGrok Bot (@spacexai):\n• Premium: €30/mo → ~1.97B tokens/mo (€0.0158/1M)\n• Super: €100/mo → ~7.35B tokens/mo (€0.0139/1M)\n\nBoth include a persistent cloud https://t.co/87489lmIO9 https://t.co/aJlD6LKSEU",
